"字幕与相邻上下文超过本次请求容量，请缩短过长字幕后重试。" = "Subtitles and adjacent contexts exceed the capacity of this request. Please shorten the long subtitles and try again.";
"无法连接翻译服务，请检查地址和网络。" = "Unable to connect to the translation service, please check the address and network.";
"服务名称不能为空。" = "The service name cannot be empty.";
"服务地址与任务参数不同，请调整任务翻译参数或恢复服务地址。" = "The service address is different from the task parameters. Please adjust the task translation parameters or restore the service address.";
"服务要求鉴权，请配置 API 密钥。" = "The service requires authentication. Please configure the API key.";
"服务配置包含重复 ID，未加载损坏配置。" = "The service configuration contains duplicate IDs, and the damaged configuration is not loaded.";
"服务配置正在读取或保存，请稍后再试。" = "The service configuration is being read or saved. Please try again later.";
"服务配置读取失败，请重新读取或保存有效配置后再处理。" = "The service configuration reading failed. Please re-read or save the valid configuration before processing.";
"服务配置读取失败：%@" = "Service configuration reading failure: %1$@";
"服务限流（HTTP 429）。" = "Service rate limit reached (HTTP 429).";
"服务限流（HTTP 429）。请稍后重试失败批次。" = "Rate limited (HTTP 429). Retry the failed batch later.";
"服务限流（HTTP 429），Retry-After：%@。请稍后重试失败批次。" = "Rate limited (HTTP 429). Retry-After: %@. Retry the failed batch later.";
"本次任务引用的翻译服务未在此设备配置，请配置本次服务或将任务绑定到已有服务。" = "The translation service referenced by this task is not configured on this device. Please configure this service or bind the task to the existing service.";
"模型 %@ 的聊天接口可用" = "Chat endpoint available for model %1$@";
"翻译服务暂时不可用（HTTP %lld），本批次未提交。" = "The translation service is temporarily unavailable (HTTP %1$lld), and this batch has not been submitted.";
"翻译服务返回 HTTP %lld，本批次未提交。" = "The translation service returned HTTP %1$lld, and this batch has not been submitted.";
"翻译结果缺失或格式无效，本批次未保存。" = "Translation results are missing or invalid. This batch was not saved.";
"翻译请求超时，本批次未提交，请重试。" = "The translation request has timed out. This batch has not been submitted. Please try again.";
"翻译输入为空、重复或与当前字幕不一致。" = "The translation input is empty, duplicate or inconsistent with the current subtitle.";
"聊天响应未完整结束（%@），本批次未提交。" = "The chat response did not end completely (%1$@), and this batch was not submitted.";
"聊天接口返回了无效的响应。" = "The chat interface returned an invalid response.";
"请稍后重试失败批次。" = "Please retry the failed batch later.";
"请输入有效的 HTTP 或 HTTPS 服务地址。" = "Please enter a valid HTTP or HTTPS service address.";
"转写服务读取失败：%@" = "The transcription service failed to read: %1$@";
"配置未保存，旧密钥恢复也失败：%@。请重新配置密钥。" = "The configuration is not saved, and the old key recovery also fails: %1$@. Please reconfigure the key.";
"鉴权失败：API 密钥无效或未授权。" = "Authentication failure: The API key is invalid or unauthorized.";
